"Sina-art'h was the Primary's daughter and Stuart's sister, a knight."
"She had short-cropped almost-white hair, dark circles and a wounded look."
"At about eighteen or nineteen she chose her rest, and the Primary released her with his skill."
"Stuart had meant to be her votary, and now bears her mourning name, Sina."
"Her skill Returning Guardblade grew stronger against obstacles between her and her charge."
"She promised Stu she would always make it back home, and she did."
